From dedbbd01a5f4d7f4f0d2b637f78d10dd72ee7e54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:03:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] glm_moe_dsa: prompt exchanges by reduce-scatter, then a bf16
 all-gather

wholeDsa all-gathered every rank's fp32 partial of a 4,096-row chunk
(each rank took in W - 1 partials, 500 MB at TP=6) and summed them on every
rank: 47% of a TP=6 prompt chunk. A prompt chunk at W >= 3 now
reduce-scatters the partials (each rank sums its own ceil(R / W) rows),
adds them to its residual rows and all-gathers the bf16 residual rows,
about a quarter of the bytes. TF_GLM_DSA_SCATTER=0 keeps the all-gathers.
Adds ncclReduceScatter to the NCCL binding.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UQVvNktFCvQrvpNUbqtqBX
---
 zig/src/cuda/nccl.zig                 |  1 +
 zig/src/families/glm/cuda_forward.zig | 61 +++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

